698	/** Fill the claim form. `clear` (an add) also empties every field the test does not give (a
699	 *  blank date takes the default), so nothing typed for a refused add carries into this one; an
700	 *  edit leaves the fields it is not given as the editor filled them. */
701	async function fillClaimForm(r: Locator, f: ClaimFields, clear = false) {
